1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,520
You tapped Pay once. The app made two orders.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,140
Nothing you did was wrong.

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:10,080
An old page after an update. Someone else's name.

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:16,120
A date one day off. A deleted record that still shows.

5
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:19,510
Flaw. Control. Repair. Retest.

6
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:28,830
Each glitch rebuilt as a small pretend app on a laptop.

7
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:34,360
Without a ticket number: two attempts, two orders.

8
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:39,880
With a ticket number: two attempts, one order.

9
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:47,830
Everyday objects explain each strange moment.

10
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:50,880
Made-up data, local machine.

11
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:56,230
Not an audit of any real product.

12
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:59,500
Watch the films. Run the tests yourself.

13
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,360
The repository, linked below.
